97
00:07:30,784 --> 00:07:32,077
Oh. Mungkin saja.

98
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,161
Uh, Kuorum Quadling
ingin memberimu penghargaan.

99
00:07:33,244 --> 00:07:34,871
Mereka hanya belum tahu
penghargaan untuk apa.

100
00:07:34,954 --> 00:07:37,624
-Senang mendengarnya.
-Dan seseorang mengirim kue-kue.

101
00:07:38,208 --> 00:07:39,376
Baguslah.

102
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:40,794
Hei, tolong kirim ini ke pondokku.

103
00:07:40,877 --> 00:07:42,921
Gaun-gaun dari minggu lalu?

104
00:07:43,004 --> 00:07:44,839
Oh, mungkin, berikan saja
pada yang kurang beruntung.

105
00:07:44,923 --> 00:07:47,050
Oh, tentu. Ide bagus.

106
00:07:47,133 --> 00:07:49,177
Dan, kau tahu, selagi kita melakukannya,
kita benar-benar harus

107
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:50,804
mematenkan kata "baik".

108
00:07:50,887 --> 00:07:53,098
-Ooh. Itu ba…
-Ooh.

109
00:07:53,181 --> 00:07:54,808
Maksudku, aku merinding.

110
00:07:54,891 --> 00:07:56,351
Bulu kudukku berteriak.

111
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:58,645
-Aku sangat suka pekerjaanku.
-Aw. Baguslah.

112
00:07:59,688 --> 00:08:00,689
Madame Morrible.

113
00:08:01,314 --> 00:08:03,858
Maaf membuatmu menunggu. Aku tidak tahu.

114
00:08:05,276 --> 00:08:07,195
Terjadi sesuatu? Apa soal Elphaba?

115
00:08:07,737 --> 00:08:09,698
Maksudmu si Penyihir Jahat?

116
00:08:09,781 --> 00:08:10,907
Benar, tentu saja.

117
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:13,785
-Masuklah, masuklah.
-Nyonya Morrible…

118
00:08:13,868 --> 00:08:16,579
-Apa Anda ingin kami mencatat untuk Anda?
-…Aku bi… bisa ambilkan, camilan.

119
00:08:16,663 --> 00:08:17,706
Anda mau camilan?

120
00:08:17,789 --> 00:08:20,083
Seperti cherry frazzle atau juice puff?

121
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,377
"Nyonya Morrible"?

122
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:24,295
-She's not married.
-Kau se…

123
00:08:25,672 --> 00:08:27,340
Peresmian Jalan Bata Kuning

124
00:08:27,424 --> 00:08:30,176
sudah dekat dan serangan si Penyihir Jahat

125
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:32,929
makin berani. Masyarakat mulai resah.

126
00:08:33,430 --> 00:08:35,598
Jadi sekarang jauh lebih penting

127
00:08:35,682 --> 00:08:38,393
bagimu untuk membangkitkan semangat
semua orang,

128
00:08:39,185 --> 00:08:41,187
hanya kau yang mampu melakukannya.

129
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:43,982
Maka dari itu.

130
00:08:46,234 --> 00:08:47,652
Oh, Madame, aku suka.

131
00:08:48,319 --> 00:08:49,320
Benda apa itu?

132
00:08:50,613 --> 00:08:52,657
Moda transportasi barumu.

133
00:08:52,741 --> 00:08:55,910
Kendaraan gelembung bulat milikmu sendiri.

134
00:08:56,953 --> 00:08:58,830
Jadi, semacam gelembung?

135
00:09:02,083 --> 00:09:03,084
Tentu.

136
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:12,469
Apa seharusnya begitu?

137
00:09:12,552 --> 00:09:13,470
Tidak apa-apa.

138
00:09:14,471 --> 00:09:15,305
Anda yakin?

139
00:09:16,848 --> 00:09:18,016
A…

140
00:09:21,394 --> 00:09:22,937
Apa fungsinya seperti dugaanku?

141
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,275
Tidak!

142
00:09:32,864 --> 00:09:33,698
Aku tidak sanggup.

143
00:09:35,408 --> 00:09:36,451
Mustahil!

144
00:09:40,789 --> 00:09:42,290
Aku terobsesi sekali.

145
00:09:42,373 --> 00:09:45,168
Sang Wizard membuatnya khusus untukmu.

146
00:09:45,251 --> 00:09:49,214
Beliau merasa penting bagimu,
sang Penyihir Baik

147
00:09:49,297 --> 00:09:51,007
untuk bisa terbang juga.

148
00:09:52,008 --> 00:09:52,842
Aku setuju.

149
00:09:55,011 --> 00:09:57,055
Jangan cemas soal ketidakmampuanmu

150
00:09:57,138 --> 00:09:59,057
melakukan sihir sungguhan.

151
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:02,060
Penemuan ini akan menutupi kekuranganmu.

152
00:10:02,811 --> 00:10:06,356
Mekanisme gelembung ini
tersembunyi dengan cerdik.

153
00:10:06,439 --> 00:10:09,859
Orang-orang akan mengira
bahwa kaulah yang membuatnya melayang

154
00:10:09,943 --> 00:10:12,445
dengan kekuatan sihirmu sendiri.

155
00:10:12,529 --> 00:10:14,948
Jadi, biarkan saja mereka mengira begitu.

156
00:10:16,199 --> 00:10:17,116
Tentu.

157
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:19,786
Tapi jangan lupakan ini.

158
00:10:31,214 --> 00:10:33,633
Tongkat sihirnya benar-benar meyakinkan.

159
00:10:38,137 --> 00:10:40,390
Sampai jumpa di upacara pembukaan.

160
00:10:40,473 --> 00:10:41,808
Terima kasih banyak.

161
00:10:58,992 --> 00:11:00,577
<i>Tongkat sihir?</i>

162
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,954
<i>Selamat ulang tahun, Galinda.</i>

163
00:11:05,748 --> 00:11:08,251
Inilah yang paling kuinginkan.

164
00:11:08,334 --> 00:11:09,919
Ayo, cobalah.

165
00:11:10,003 --> 00:11:13,339
Ya, coba tunjukkan!

166
00:11:13,423 --> 00:11:16,467
Sihir! Sihir! Sihir! Sihir! Sihir!

167
00:11:16,551 --> 00:11:17,427
Ayolah.

168
00:11:31,357 --> 00:11:34,193
Oh. Aku lupa merapal mantranya.

169
00:11:34,277 --> 00:11:35,403
Oh! -Oh, ya.

170
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:37,238
Tongkatnya. Ya. Ya. Ya.

171
00:11:38,197 --> 00:11:44,579
Dengan ini kuperintahkan
agar keajaiban terjadi!

172
00:11:44,662 --> 00:11:46,497
Dia bahkan tak bisa membuat percikan api.

173
00:11:46,581 --> 00:11:49,417
Lihat! Ada pelangi.

174
00:11:50,501 --> 00:11:51,753
Wow.

175
00:11:53,338 --> 00:11:54,172
Kau yang membuatnya?

176
00:11:55,006 --> 00:11:55,548
Um…

177
00:11:56,382 --> 00:11:58,801
Yah, kau tahu sendiri
betapa aku suka pelangi.

178
00:11:59,385 --> 00:12:00,386
Oh, wow!

179
00:12:01,262 --> 00:12:02,805
Itu temanku!

180
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:06,517
[POPSICLE] Lihat pelanginya!

181
00:12:06,601 --> 00:12:08,186
Bukankah itu luar biasa?

182
00:12:08,811 --> 00:12:11,481
Siapa yang siap makan kue?

183
00:12:11,564 --> 00:12:13,608
Temui Rosie dan Posie.

184
00:12:18,363 --> 00:12:19,614
Ada apa, sayangku?

185
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:22,325
Kau sudah dapatkan semua maumu.

186
00:12:22,408 --> 00:12:24,994
Aku tahu, tapi aku ingin punya sihir.

187
00:12:25,662 --> 00:12:26,746
Sihir sungguhan.

188
00:12:26,829 --> 00:12:29,332
Dan… aku tidak memilikinya.

189
00:12:29,916 --> 00:12:34,212
Oh, tapi sayangku,
semua orang mencintaimu.

190
00:12:35,213 --> 00:12:38,925
Percayalah, hanya itu yang kau butuhkan.

191
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,427
Mana senyummu?

192
00:12:42,261 --> 00:12:43,346
Itu baru gadisku.

193
00:12:58,987 --> 00:13:01,572
Sayang, kau ikut?

194
00:13:05,243 --> 00:13:06,202
Ayo!

195
00:13:33,438 --> 00:13:34,564
Glinda!

196
00:13:40,862 --> 00:13:43,531
Warga Oz sekalian, kabar baik.

197
00:13:44,323 --> 00:13:47,160
Kini, akhirnya, semua jalan berujung
pada Wizard.

198
00:13:48,161 --> 00:13:50,872
<i>♪ Oh, perayaan hebat apa
yang kita punya hari ini ♪</i>

199
00:13:50,955 --> 00:13:52,415
<i>♪ Syukurlah ♪</i>

200
00:13:52,498 --> 00:13:55,626
<i>♪ Mari berpesta dengan gaya Glinda ♪</i>

201
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:57,170
<i>♪ Syukurlah ♪</i>

202
00:13:57,253 --> 00:14:00,882
<i>♪ Akhirnya, hari yang benar-benar bebas
dari Penyihir Jahat ♪</i>

203
00:14:00,965 --> 00:14:03,593
<i>♪ Kami sangat bahagia ♪</i>

204
00:14:03,676 --> 00:14:05,136
<i>♪ Syukurlah ♪</i>

205
00:14:06,137 --> 00:14:08,431
Terima kasih padamu, Glinda,

206
00:14:08,514 --> 00:14:11,601
